{
    "name": "dsh-wallet",
    "version": "1.3.3",
    "description": "DeepSeek 钱包（DSH 插件）：显示账户余额 · 今日累计 · 本会话消耗（悬停看 token/金额明细）· 可编辑提醒阈值与低余额/超阈值系统通知，一键打开官方充值 / API Key / 用量页，并注册 query_deepseek_balance 工具。入口注册在官方 sidebar.footer.action 槽；装了 dsh-vk-suite 时用它的常驻面板位。",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "lib/index.js",
    "exports": {
        ".": {
            "default": "./lib/index.js"
        },
        "./client": {
            "default": "./lib/client.js"
        },
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "dsh": {
        "bundle": {
            "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
        },
        "client": {
            "inject": [
                "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
            ],
            "platform": "web"
        }
    },
    "peerDependencies": {
        "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.0-rc.6 || ^0.1.5-rc.2",
        "react": "^18.2.0"
    },
    "files": [
        "lib",
        "cordis.patch.yml",
        "README.md",
        "README.en.md",
        "docs",
        "LICENSE",
        "assets"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "keywords": [
        "dsh",
        "deepseek-harness",
        "plugin",
        "deepseek",
        "balance",
        "wallet",
        "usage",
        "quota"
    ],
    "author": "Ln1m (https://github.com/Ln1m)",
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "git+https://github.com/Ln1m/dsh-chrome-suite.git",
        "directory": "dsh-wallet"
    },
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Ln1m/dsh-chrome-suite/tree/main/dsh-wallet#readme",
    "bugs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Ln1m/dsh-chrome-suite/issues"
    }
}
